{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02607","headline":"古意六首 一 · 王绩","name":"古意六首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽人在何所？紫岩有仙躅。\n月下横宝琴，此外将安欲。\n材抽峄山干，徽点崑丘玉。\n漆抱蛟龙唇，丝缠凤凰足。\n前弹广陵罢，後以明光续。\n百金买一声，千金传一曲。\n世无锺子期，谁知心所属。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02607.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02607","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}